      "id": "b870661b-79cb-45c9-855e-54e04fef4088",
      "name": "Streamlit App (Webhook Entry)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [100, -200],
      "webhookId": "3d047310-11a9-4b30-a0bc-7e144e70ffca",
      "notes": "PENTING: Setelah import, buat credential 'Header Auth' baru di n8n (Settings > Credentials), lalu pilih di node ini. Header auth ini yang menggantikan Google Auth Validator lama yang tidak berfungsi. App Streamlit kamu harus kirim header yang sama persis saat memanggil webhook ini."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.cs_query_veronika }}",
                    "rightValue": "",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Veronika"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.cs_query_leonardo }}",
                    "rightValue": "",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Leonardo"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.query }}",
                    "rightValue": "",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "MainOrchestrator"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "fallbackOutput": "none" }
      },
      "id": "router-switch-001",
      "name": "Request Router",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [300, -200],
      "notes": "Menggantikan fan-out ke 3 agent sekaligus. Sekarang 1 request cuma memicu 1 agent yang relevan, berdasarkan field mana yang terisi di body request. Urutan pengecekan: Veronika > Leonardo > Main Orchestrator."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "agent": "toolsAgent",
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.body.query }}",
        "hasOutputParser": false,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Kamu adalah asisten pencari kerja. Gunakan tool yang tersedia untuk menjawab pertanyaan user berdasarkan data lowongan yang ada. Jangan mengarang informasi lowongan yang tidak ada di database."
        }
      },
      "id": "d899f28a-bc6a-4b91-a044-248955350d9d",
      "name": "Main Orchestrator Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [600, -300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $json.body.user_id || $json.body.session_id }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 10
      },
      "id": "memory-main-001",
      "name": "Memory (Main Orchestrator)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [600, -450],
      "notes": "Butuh user_id atau session_id dikirim dari Streamlit di setiap request supaya history percakapan per-user tidak tercampur."
